      <p class="hv-article-byline">
        LeadsFlo Editorial · November 4, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="hv-article-answer">
        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>HVAC lead generation works best when campaigns distinguish repair calls, replacement estimates, maintenance inquiries and commercial projects, then connect suitable prospects with the right team.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hv-article-cta">
        <strong>HVAC LEAD GENERATION</strong>
        <p>
          See how LeadsFlo connects HVAC advertising,
